# Knight quest: grab the key, open the chest, and watch out for slimes!
background is green
hero is a knight at left, size 48
🐶 follows hero 3
make a slime at right
make a bat at top right
slime chases hero 1
bat chases hero 1.5
make a key at random place
make a chest at bottom right
hearts is 3
show "❤️ {hearts}" at top left
hero says "Find the key!"

when left key is pressed: move hero left 6
when right key is pressed: move hero right 6
when up key is pressed: move hero up 6
when down key is pressed: move hero down 6

when hero touches key:
    remove that key
    play powerup sound
    hero says "Now the chest!"

when hero touches chest:
    remove that chest
    hero becomes a wizard
    hero says "I found magic!"
    play win sound
    stop

when hero touches slime:
    subtract 1 from hearts
    play hit sound
    hero goes to left
    if hearts is 0:
        hero says "Oh no!"
        play lose sound
        stop

when hero touches bat:
    subtract 1 from hearts
    play hit sound
    hero goes to left
    if hearts is 0:
        hero says "Oh no!"
        play lose sound
        stop
